Now fix the concurrentSplitAndAncestorRecall test. Current assertions:

```java
        if (split == 201) {
            // 拆分先提交：父批 SPLIT，子批建立但随祖先召回不可用
            assertEquals("SPLIT", ...parent...);   // WRONG: recall then sets RECALLED
            assertLeaf("PROD-S", 3, childA, true, parent);
        } else {
            assertEquals(409, split);
            assertEquals("RECALLED", ...parent...);
            assertEquals(0, ...children...);
        }
```

When split==201 (split committed first), recall then sets parent RECALLED (SPLIT → RECALLED allowed). So parent final status = RECALLED in both branches. Fix:

```java
        if (split == 201) {
            // 拆分先提交：子批已建立，随后召回使父批 RECALLED、子批不可用
            assertEquals("RECALLED", ...parent...);
            assertEquals("QUARANTINED", ...childA...);
            assertLeaf("PROD-S", 3, childA, true, parent);
        } else {
            assertEquals(409, split);
            assertEquals("RECALLED", ...parent...);
            no children
        }
```

Also `assertLeaf("PROD-S", ...)` — product is PROD-S in that test. Yes it uses PROD-S.

